<%#
  The count badges of a list of shipped items (#1918), as Admin -> Required
  Pages heads its add-on pages: shared by every admin screen that syncs
  shipped content.

  locals:
    syncCounts  { new?, modified, current }; `new` is drawn only when given
                (a list that never has new items omits it)

  One named object, not loose locals: an include also sees its parent's data,
  so a loose name could be picked up from the screen by accident.
%>
<% if (typeof syncCounts.new === 'number') { %><span class="badge bg-primary" data-sync-count="new"><%= syncCounts.new %> New</span><% } %>
<span class="badge bg-warning text-dark" data-sync-count="modified"><%= syncCounts.modified %> Modified</span>
<span class="badge bg-success" data-sync-count="current"><%= syncCounts.current %> Current</span>
